flowchart LR
	START["the session starts:<br/>on_session_start resets<br/>the dylib is loaded once per process"]
	TURNS["turns run through the 6-hook chain:<br/>large outputs become markers<br/>retrieve only when detail is needed"]
	FILL["the context fills:<br/>the engine records usage<br/>via update_from_response"]
	CLOSE["close or restart:<br/>a hard reset - no session-end<br/>hook exists"]
	FRESH["a fresh store, no hook fires"]
	GONE["every prior marker becomes<br/>unresolvable at once"]
	REBUILD["a rebuilt dylib takes effect<br/>only after the session restarts"]
	START --> TURNS --> FILL
	FILL -.->|next turn| TURNS
	FILL --> CLOSE --> FRESH --> GONE
	RESTART -.-> CLOSE
